Route requests with the given method to the handler.

# Example

```rust
use axum::{
    routing::on,
    Router,
    routing::MethodFilter,
};

async fn handler() {}

// Requests to `POST /` will go to `handler`.
let app = Router::new().route("/", on(MethodFilter::POST, handler));
